{
  "name": "Podcast RSS Active Brand Sponsors, Promo Codes & Guest Contact Extractor",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ Podcast RSS Active Brand Sponsors, Promo Codes & Guest Contact Extractor\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nDiscover brands actively paying to sponsor podcasts via promo code detection in episode show notes, plus host booking emails.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/podcast-rss-sponsor-guest-extractor`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/podcast-rss-sponsor-guest-extractor) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify Podcast RSS Sponsor, Promo & Guest Extractor** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract, deduplicate, and score live structured JSON records!",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "577b28b6-b871-4339-aba1-4d490a7a1704",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🔎 Stage 1: Schedule, Target Queries & Apify Extraction\nTriggers daily, sets your target search queries and `maxItems`, and runs the cookie-free **Podcast RSS Sponsor, Promo & Guest Extractor** Actor synchronously via the Apify REST API.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 740
      },
      "id": "6ace69de-1b66-4b07-a7eb-3ceedf06da52",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 1 Extraction",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🧹 Stage 2: Quality Filtering, Deduplication, Lead Scoring & Export\nFilters verified records, deduplicates by URL/ID, normalizes and scores each record with JavaScript, summarizes the batch, and routes high-priority items downstream.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 980
      },
      "id": "8b0626a1-fdb9-4c62-a95a-e0bf18086877",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 2 Processing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        950,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 24
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "8f4d8e32-e553-4653-a998-ee51b625a9ea",
      "name": "Daily Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        200,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "b2ecf946-58e1-4eea-a209-b329cd1368db",
              "name": "queries",
              "value": "[\"B2B SaaS growth podcasts\",\"health & longevity top podcasts\"]",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "d1adec60-428b-49a5-a9c1-78afb553420d",
              "name": "maxItems",
              "value": 25,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "ffacb7ff-cb7b-44a4-a8b9-4cd12be2178a",
